      {
        "author": "Janice M.",
        "date": "2025-08-30T01:39:06Z",
        "id": "68b26509e9c1031fb6ba4bb4",
        "label": "Excellent",
        "locale": "en_US",
        "rating": 10,
        "responses": [
          {
            "date": "Sep 15, 2025",
            "id": "b9b80c3e-7440-4d2d-a2b9-7aab107c4afb",
            "locale": "en_us",
            "response": "Thank you so much for your wonderful review! We’re thrilled to hear that the whole family enjoyed the pool, playhouse, and chef’s kitchen. It’s great to know the music system, game nights, and private en-suite bedrooms added to your stay, and that the air conditioning kept everyone comfortable.\n\nWe also appreciate your note about the 4th-floor view—this is the first time we’ve received feedback on it, and we’ll keep it in mind. We’re so glad it didn’t detract from an exceptional week, and we’d love to welcome you back anytime!",
            "user": "VrboOwner"
          }
        ],
        "text": "Loved everything about this house and pool. We had children and they loved the pool and the playhouse. The kitchen is a chef’s dream! You could play music from your phone in any room or the whole house. We loved playing games at the dining room table. The air conditioning worked fantastic thru the whole house. We loved the privacy of all the bedrooms and private en-suite. The only thing we could say is that there is no gulf view from the 4th floor (but there may have been until other properties were built around this one). Was an exceptional week!",
        "themes": [
          "Liked: Cleanliness, check-in, communication, location, listing accuracy"
        ],
        "verified": true
      }
